 r←Test_Server_400(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;html;oldLayoutFlag;newLayoutFlag
⍝ Ask for the home page; pretends to be a Browser
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 r←T._Failed

 html←∆GetHtmlFromServer'[tatin-test]'
 oldLayoutFlag←∨/'<h2>Main page</h2>'⍷html
 newLayoutFlag←∨/'<h1 id="my-logo"><a href="/" title="Link to Tatin-Test main page"><img id="logo" src="/Assets/img/tatin.png" alt=""><span>Tatin Test Registry</span></a></h1>'⍷html
 →T.PassesIf oldLayoutFlag⍲newLayoutFlag

 r←T._OK
⍝Done
